### Invalid projectId Error Proof (Phase 1)

Environment note:
- Direct HTTP capture is constrained by sandbox socket restrictions.
- Error envelope is validated by middleware tests and route error handling.

POST /api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "test_key"
}

Expected 400 Response Body:
{
  "error": {
    "code": "PROJECT_ID_REQUIRED",
    "message": "projectId is required",
    "requestId": "<uuid>"
  }
}

